              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 4.5: Heating effect in a wire"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.435,
            0.383,
            0.457
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Think like a scientist"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.474,
            0.732,
            0.508
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This activity should be carried out strictly under the supervision of a teacher."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.138,
            0.508,
            0.732,
            0.559
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Repeat Activity 4.5 with a battery of 2 cells. What do you notice? For the same duration, does the wire heat up more with one cell or two cells?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.559,
            0.732,
            0.646
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The amount of heat generated is more in the experiment with 2 cells. This is due to the fact that the heat generated depends on the magnitude of the electric current. The heat generated in a wire depends on the material, thickness, length of the wire, and the duration for which the current flows."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.73,
            0.543,
            0.834,
            0.649
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.73,
                0.543,
                0.834,
                0.649
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_7_image_13.jpg",
